{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"সুনান আবু দাউদ","section":{"29":"Medicine (Kitab Al-Tibb)"},"section_detail":{"29":{"hadithnumber_first":3855,"hadithnumber_last":3903,"arabicnumber_first":3855,"arabicnumber_last":3903,"name_native":"চিকিৎসা অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3863,"arabicnumber":3863,"text":"। জাবির (রাঃ) সূত্রে বর্ণিত। রাসূলুল্লাহ সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম এর হাড় মচকে গেলে তিনি এর জন্য রক্তমোক্ষণ করান।[1] সহীহ।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":29,"hadith":9}}]}